      "procedure": "Preheat oven to 175°C.\n\nGrease a 9x5 inch baking dish with melted butter. Place the Monde Cheese Bar cubes evenly inside the dish.\n\nIn a bowl, whisk together milk, heavy cream, eggs, sugar, vanilla extract, and salt.\n\nSplit the custard into 2 separate bowl. Add ube halaya and ube extract on one bowl. Mix until well combined.\n\nPour the plain custard over cheese bar. Lightly press the cheese bar to absorb the custard.\n\nDrizzle ube custard on top to create marble effect. Let soak for 5-10 minutes.\n\nBake for 25–30 minutes, or until the top is slightly golden, remove from the oven. Sprinkle with brown sugar and for another 5-10 minutes.\n\n Serve warm with maple syrup and whipped cream."
